<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="t00346">
	<title>Approving software update</title>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="53*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="47*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e01492">
								<figgroup>
									<image align="center" href="../../images/N_CT25Z002_E.eps" scale="95" placement="break"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2">
							<ol outputclass="callout">
								<li>
									<p> <uicontrol>Update Now</uicontrol> </p>
								</li>
								<li>
									<p> <uicontrol>Later</uicontrol> </p>
								</li>
							</ol>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>After the vehicle is turned off, the vehicle system will allow you to start the update.</p>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<p>To start the update, press <uicontrol>Update Now</uicontrol> (1).</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>To postpone the update, press <uicontrol>Later</uicontrol> (2).</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</conbody>
</concept>